	(text "Pro Micro mode: a controller without the nice!nano's three inner pins needs\nJP4 (COL5 to P0.24), JP5 (COL6 to P0.11) and JP6 (ROW5 to P0.08) bridged.\nLeave them open with a nice!nano, or two controller pins drive one net."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 172.72 0)
		(effects
